<td id="S2.T1.2.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Gain modulation of <math id="S2.T1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{p}^{\top}A_{p}V_{p}W_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{p}^{\top}A_{p}V_{p}W_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
